<h1>Briefings</h1>
<p>An AI-curated daily briefing on agentic commerce and payments &mdash; checkout protocols, machine-to-machine payments, treasury agents, stablecoin settlement &mdash; plus the wider AI/agent ecosystem.</p>
<p>Sourced daily from RSS/news, Reddit, Hacker News, X, and newsletters, then summarized by an LLM.</p>
